<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-balance-druid-dps">Shoulders for Balance Druid DPS</h4>With the release of Zul'Aman our pre-bis is now <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69551/feathers-of-akilzon">
<img alt="Feathers of Akil'zon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Feathers of Akil'zon</span></a>. For second bis - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57866/mantle-of-soft-shadows">
<img alt="Mantle of Soft Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Soft Shadows</span></a> is a very tiny amount better than <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56361/mantle-of-bestilled-winds">
<img alt="Mantle of Bestilled Winds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Bestilled Winds</span></a> thanks to it having a second socket.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a> requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
