<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-balance-druid-dps">Back for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a> is the strongest cloak for pre-raid, but as it's a world drop it is really rare to find and can be expensive on the auction house. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58194/heavenly-breeze">
<img alt="Heavenly Breeze" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_healer_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavenly Breeze</span></a> is close if you can't afford <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75172/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> if tailor.<div class="pad"></div>
