<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-balance-druid-dps">Chest for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60281/stormriders-vestment">
<img alt="Stormrider's Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Vestment</span></a> is our best option, the only close alternative is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56561/chestguard-of-natures-fury">
<img alt="Chestguard of Nature's Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of Nature's Fury</span></a>. Since you only need 6-7 heroics to afford <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60281/stormriders-vestment">
<img alt="Stormrider's Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Vestment</span></a> you will rarely consider any options. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69623/vestments-of-the-soulflayer">
<img alt="Vestments of the Soulflayer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestments of the Soulflayer</span></a> can be nice if you get lucky since the chest is rather far down on how we prioritize our points.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
