<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-balance-druid-dps">Neck for Balance Druid DPS</h4>There are 2 necklaces we will mainly be looking for, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a> which is our best necklace but also a rare world drop and can be quite expensive. There is also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62416/yellow-smoke-pendant">
<img alt="Yellow Smoke Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Yellow Smoke Pendant</span></a> (H) /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62434/lightning-flash-pendant">
<img alt="Lightning Flash Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Flash Pendant</span></a> (A) which is our 2nd best and from rep, making it more accessible.<div class="pad"></div>
